Package: resolve
Title: Species Composition Prediction via Linear Vector Embeddings
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Gilles", "Colling", email = "gilles.colling@uliege.be", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predict plot-level environmental attributes from species composition
    using linear compositional pooling and learned representations. The package
    provides a C++ core engine with libtorch for optional GPU acceleration, with
    both hash-based and transformer-based species encoding modes.
